      <description>Reading Group In the Spring of 2026, I organized a reading course on commutative algebra. We met Wednesdays 12:40 - 1:35 PM in MW 152.
Schedule [Here] is a list of problems from Atiyah-Macdonald that we worked through. Another good resource is Altman-Kleiman&amp;rsquo;s A Term in Commutative Algebra which is essentially Atiyah-Macdonald++. Below is a list of dates we met as well as the problems for each day to discuss. The bolded problems were the ones that we presented each day.</description>
